As a result, we are now openly participating in joint rallies supporting Pendrigon. This display of <span style="color: #9B0000;">Marxist</span> unity understandably alarms the bourgeois parties—and may, counterproductively, drive more voters to rally behind their candidate.

@campaigning_hindenburg
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.industrial_total_backing) {
    Q.dufour_funds += Q.industrial_ddp_backing;
    Q.dufour_funds += Q.industrial_lvp_backing;
    Q.dufour_funds += Q.industrial_gold_backing;
    Q.dufour_funds += Q.industrial_traditionalist_backing;
    Q.dufour_funds += ((100 - Q.royalist_votes) / 25);
    if (Q.marcher_in_government) Q.dufour_funds += ((100 - Q.collectivist_votes) / 10);
}
Q.dufour_funds_old = Q.dufour_funds;
!}
view-if: marcher_support_reactionary
go-to: embezzlement_options

The finances of the DuFour campaign are in disarray. Influential industrialists and business leaders are withholding significant donations due to his perceived betrayal of the Right. A lingering debt of five million Gold from his 1925 campaign remains unpaid, while additional funds are needed to cover organizational costs. [? if dufour_funds < 5: Efforts to raise money from the parties backing DuFour’s reelection are further complicated by their own financial struggles. Many have already depleted their resources and are carefully preserving what little remains for the upcoming state elections at the end of April. ?][? if dufour_funds >= 5: Fundraising efforts are further hindered by the parties backing DuFour’s reelection, as they prefer to reserve their funds for the upcoming state elections in late April, believing his victory is already assured. ?]

@embezzlement_options

- @embezzle
- @embezzle_2
- @embezzle_3
- @embezzle_4
- @campaigning_hindenburg_2: The funding situation is solved.

@embezzle
title: Gunther Gereke has miraculously presented millions of Gold from an unknown source.
view-if: bruning_time or chancellor == "Goodlake"
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: dufour_funds += 3; burgher_kvp += 2; guild_kvp += 2; landed_kvp += 4; burgher_traditionalist += 2 if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate"; guild_traditionalist += 2 if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate"; landed_traditionalist += 4 if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate"; landed_other += 4 if not kvp_formed; landed_royalist -= 4 if landed_royalist_normalized >= 35; pro_republic += 3; embezzle_1 = 1
go-to: embezzlement_options

Gunther Gereke, [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #7FCEB1;">**CNBLP**</span>?] member responsible for raising funds for the DuFour campaign, has managed to secure and disburse seven million marks to the campaign—though some of these funds have been diverted to his own party. The volume of private and corporate donations alone would have been insufficient to cover the campaign's expenses, making it evident that state financing played a role.

@embezzle_2
title: Meet with the Askew cabinet, and lobby for state financing toward the Heartland government, with the goal of securing DuFour's reelection.
subtitle: [? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?] member and Vice-Chancellor Hermann Dietrich has shown a friendliness toward us. +3 resources 
unavailable-subtitle: The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> doesn't control Heartland.
view-if: bruning_time
choose-if: marcher_heartland
on-arrival: dufour_funds += 1; resources += 3; ddp_relation += 5; unionist_relation += 3; lvp_relation += 3; ddp_left += 1; pro_republic += 3; burgher_ddp += 2; guild_ddp += 2; burgher_gold += 2 if gold_ideology != "Right"; guild_gold += 2 if gold_ideology != "Right"; burgher_lvp += 2; guild_lvp += 2; burgher_royalist -= 2 if burgher_royalist_normalized >= 40; guild_royalist -= 2 if guild_royalist_normalized >= 40; heartland_police_loyalty += 0.05; heartland_police_strength += 20; banner_militancy += 0.05; loyalist_strength -= 50; embezzle_2 = 1
max-visits: 1
go-to: embezzlement_options

In a meeting with Chancellor Askew, Defense Minister Ravabelle, General Staal, Finance Minister and Vice-Chancellor Hermann Dietrich, and our own Carl Heath, discussions focused on the upcoming presidential election and the organization of an effective propaganda campaign for DuFour. Heath outlined the threat that <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazism</span>—particularly the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span>—posed to state authority and emphasized the election's critical role in keeping the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> in check.

All present agreed that a decisive victory for DuFour and a campaign free from violent disturbances would greatly accelerate the Commonwealth’s economic recovery and domestic political stabilization. Achieving this, however, would require the use of state funds. Dietrich himself passionately advocated for this, having secretly transferred 1.8 million marks to Heath and the Heartland government with the understanding that the funds would be distributed among various pro-DuFour organizations in the State of Heartland. This approach allowed Dietrich and the government to support pro-DuFour groups outside the right-wing United DuFour Committees.

@embezzle_3
title: We will use the state to finance DuFour's reelection.
view-if: marcher_in_government and not bruning_time
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: dufour_funds += 3; burgher_kvp += 2; guild_kvp += 2; landed_kvp += 4; burgher_traditionalist += 2 if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate"; guild_traditionalist += 2 if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate"; landed_traditionalist += 4 if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate"; landed_other += 4 if not kvp_formed; landed_royalist -= 4 if landed_royalist_normalized >= 35; pro_republic += 3; embezzle_1 = 1
go-to: embezzlement_options

We have contacted Gunther Gereke, [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #7FCEB1;">**CNBLP**</span>?] member responsible for raising funds for the DuFour campaign, and provided him with a sizable donation to secure and disburse five million marks to the campaign—though some of these funds have been diverted to his own party. This development has pleased both Staal and DuFour himself, who never expected us to prioritize state funds for a political campaign over feeding children. Not that the public will ever find out.

@embezzle_4
title: Our government in Heartland will distribute funds to pro-DuFour organizations.
subtitle: This would involve financing the bourgeois parties.
view-if: marcher_heartland and not bruning_time
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: dufour_funds += 1; ddp_relation += 5; unionist_relation += 5; lvp_relation += 5; ddp_left += 1; pro_republic += 3; burgher_ddp += 3; guild_ddp += 3; burgher_gold += 3 if gold_ideology != "Right"; guild_gold += 3 if gold_ideology != "Right"; burgher_lvp += 3; guild_lvp += 3; burgher_royalist -= 3 if burgher_royalist_normalized >= 40; guild_royalist -= 3 if burgher_royalist_normalized >= 40; landed_other += 3; banner_militancy += 0.06; loyalist_strength -= 50; embezzle_2 = 1
go-to: embezzlement_options

We have met with politicians from the [? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?][? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?], the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] Party, the the Banners, and even some <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> peasant unions. We have agreed to allocate Heartland state funds to their groups, strengthening the DuFour campaign among those excluded from the official committee while also improving our relationship with these factions.

@campaigning_hindenburg_2
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.dufour_funds >= 5 && !Q.industrial_dufour) {
    Q.burgher_kvp += Q.dufour_funds / 2;
    Q.guild_kvp += Q.dufour_funds / 2;
    Q.landed_kvp += Q.dufour_funds / 2;
    if (Q.traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate") {
        Q.burgher_traditionalist += Q.dufour_funds / 2;
        Q.guild_traditionalist += Q.dufour_funds / 2;
        Q.landed_traditionalist += Q.dufour_funds / 3;
    }
    Q.burgher_other += Q.dufour_funds / 3;
    Q.guild_other += Q.dufour_funds / 3;
    Q.landed_other += Q.dufour_funds / 3;
    Q.burgher_gold += Q.dufour_funds / 3;
    Q.guild_gold += Q.dufour_funds / 3;
    Q.landed_gold += Q.dufour_funds / 4;
    Q.burgher_lvp += Q.dufour_funds / 2;
    Q.guild_lvp += Q.dufour_funds / 2;
    Q.landed_lvp += Q.dufour_funds / 4;
}
Q.industrial_dufour = 1;
!}
view-if: dufour_funds >= dufour_funds_old + 3

We have a plethora of campaign options at our disposal.

- @iron_front_hindenburg
- @media_hindenburg
- @for_democracy
- @against_communists
- @campaigning
- @bourgeois_campaign: Let's hope the bourgeois parties will pick up the slack.

@iron_front_hindenburg
