The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> immediately gets to work, rallying around its slogan of opposing <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Fascism</span> and <span style="color:rgb(90, 0, 0);">Stalinism</span>. Although many leftists in the alliance are reluctant to support the <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> DuFour.

