We argue to our base that, despite DuFour's well-known <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> beliefs, he has refrained from outright dismantling our democracy, and supporting him as the lesser evil is necessary. However, our strong campaign in favor of President DuFour has discredited him in the eyes of his <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> supporters who initially voted for him in 1925. This has increased DuFour's desire to distance himself from our support by shifting further to the right.

@against_communists
title: Focus our campaign against the <span style="color: #700000;">**Communist**</span> [+ communist_candidate_1932 +].
subtitle: He has gained a significant amount of support by positioning himself as the "only left candidate." -1 resource
